Hello.
I'm currently writing a paper on constructed languages as a university 
assignement, and for this purpose I'm conducting a short (9 questions) and 
rather basic survey among people who know a constructed language or have at 
least tried to learn one at some point. It's all collected anonymously. If 
anybody here could take part in the survey or pass it on to other people, 
it would help me a lot and be greatly appreciated. :)
The survey can be found here:
http://webankieta.pl/ankieta/wv1c3349

Thanks in advance,
Marta

